You aren't wearing any unidentified cursed rings by any chance, are you?
In any event, most (all?) rings, if worn, will cause you to get hungry
more often (how often depends on what ring).  If this isn't your problem,
it's not clear to me what is.  You can always #pray if you haven't done
it already when you are feeling weak for the first time.  If your god
is pleased, it will make your stomach content (I believe it's the 
equivalent of eating a food ration).  Of course, praying too soon afterward
will probably result in making your god angry (it can drain a level if
it feels like doing so).
